Build the AIR frontend as part of Mesa.

src/compiler/air is this repository's tools/mesa/air: the frontend that reads Apple's shader
bitcode and produces NIR (docs/air.md). tools/air/mk-host.sh links it there for the build on
this machine, tools/mk-mesa.sh copies it there for the cross build; this patch is only the one
line of meson that reaches it, so that both builds get it the same way and neither needs a sed.

--- a/src/compiler/meson.build
+++ b/src/compiler/meson.build
@@ -63,6 +63,8 @@
 
 subdir('spirv')
 
+subdir('air')
+
 if with_clc
   subdir('clc')
 endif
